## Outside the config (data requests)

- Azure: management NIC public IP assignment and effective NSG rules per VM-Series.
- Physical: management VLAN upstream ACLs or the network diagram.
- All: admin authentication logs, 30 to 60 days, source IP on every success and failure. Config says who can reach the login page; logs say who has.
